Build SDL2-optional consumers without SDL2.

EmberBSD keeps SDL3 only. These programs use SDL2 only for optional parts:
the openmpt123 SDL2 output (libopenmpt), the osg SDL2 viewer support,
Blender joystick input and SDL audio, the darktable gamepad module, the MLT
sdl2 consumers and Movit module (Movit needs SDL2), Krita animation audio
through MLT, the ffplay clip preview of Kdenlive, and pygame in the
py-OpenGL tests.
Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted); upstream status: not needed (upstream options).

